{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Delivery Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of logistics and delivery! In this immersive simulation game, you start as a rookie employee at a courier company until your boss suddenly leaves town and hands you the reins. Now, it's your turn to build a delivery empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take control of daily operations: deliver packages across the city, sign lucrative contracts, and grow your headquarters from a modest office to a bustling logistics hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled employees, assign tasks, and optimize your workforce to keep deliveries running smoothly. Every decision counts. Will you be a hands-on manager or a strategic mastermind?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Fleet</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in new vehicles to boost efficiency and reach. From nimble scooters to heavy-duty trucks, choose the right tools for the job and keep your fleet in top shape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate the City</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install parcel lockers in strategic locations, streamline delivery routes, and outpace the competition. Your goal? To create the most spectacular courier company the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of tycoon games or just love the thrill of building something from scratch, this game offers a rich, rewarding experience full of strategic depth and creative freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078230?t=1768378809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078230?t=1768378809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/cda59e83020efdb689df23cf91f041e2bbeff8f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768378809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/cda59e83020efdb689df23cf91f041e2bbeff8f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768378809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Delivery Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of logistics and delivery! In this immersive simulation game, you start as a rookie employee at a courier company until your boss suddenly leaves town and hands you the reins. Now, it's your turn to build a delivery empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take control of daily operations: deliver packages across the city, sign lucrative contracts, and grow your headquarters from a modest office to a bustling logistics hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled employees, assign tasks, and optimize your workforce to keep deliveries running smoothly. Every decision counts. Will you be a hands-on manager or a strategic mastermind?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Fleet</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in new vehicles to boost efficiency and reach. From nimble scooters to heavy-duty trucks, choose the right tools for the job and keep your fleet in top shape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate the City</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install parcel lockers in strategic locations, streamline delivery routes, and outpace the competition. Your goal? To create the most spectacular courier company the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of tycoon games or just love the thrill of building something from scratch, this game offers a rich, rewarding experience full of strategic depth and creative freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.poster.avif?t=1768378809\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.webm?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.mp4?t=1768378809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Digital Melody"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/7ffb52194bf760056b8f30a680027ec442aa90de/header.jpg?t=1768378809","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078230/1324788061/30fde4df603e0910129d149d013fb1731e2a8c9c/1762422771/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763022428","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078230/1324788061/30fde4df603e0910129d149d013fb1731e2a8c9c/1762422771/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763022428","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078230/1324788061/30fde4df603e0910129d149d013fb1731e2a8c9c/1762422771/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763022428","id":257227576,"name":"Parcel Delivery Simulator - Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227576/3f3d79dba3af30dfd21475d41999a04448d1cdc1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763022428"}],"name":"Parcel Delivery Simulator","package_g